&lt;p&gt;As a Sr. Product Manager, you will own strategy, roadmap, discovery, delivery, and lifecycle outcomes for a defined product area. You will work across engineering, design, go-to-market, and customer-facing teams to build for enterprise customers and their complex workflows, security needs, compliance considerations, and data privacy expectations.&lt;/p&gt;
