&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Prototyping and validation:&lt;/strong&gt; Build interactive prototypes using code-adjacent tools and validate them with real users before engineering investment. Use findings to sharpen flows, surface edge cases, and improve the work before full systemization.&lt;/li&gt;
