&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Design systems:&lt;/strong&gt; Translate and evolve Pendo&#39;s design principles into reusable components and patterns. Identify when to extend existing systems and when to push them forward, then drive those decisions with stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
